<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-U.S. Bancorp started as strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-U.S. Bancorp started as strong buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said it started coverage of U.S. Bancorp Inc on Monday with a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares were indicated to open higher from their close at $87 on the New York Stock Exchange on Friday.  They were indicated at between $88 and $92 each.</p>
<p>-- No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
